================================================================================
DATA EXCEPTION (data/ directory and character profiles)
================================================================================

While this LICENSE (MIT) covers the hersona code (scripts/, schema/*.json,
pyproject.toml, etc.), character profile data under data/ is NOT covered by
this MIT license. Each character profile retains its original per-character
license as declared in its `license` field (typically CC-BY-SA-4.0, derived
from the respective work's fanwork policy).

In short:
  - hersona code (scripts/, schema/, etc.)         → MIT (this file)
  - hersona attribute templates (attributes/**/*.yaml) → CC0 1.0 (see LICENSE-CC0.txt)
  - Character profile data (data/**/*.yaml)        → per-character license (see YAML)
